          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Unresponsive clicks and frozen animations",
            "The \"Page unresponsive\" dialog",
            "INP regressions in field data",
            "Node: health-check timeouts"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "42. Three Fixes"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Chunk: process N items, yield, continue",
            "Move off-thread: Web Worker or worker_threads for CPU work",
            "Yield with a real macrotask: setTimeout, MessageChannel, scheduler.yield",
            "A microtask yield helps zero — microtasks are what starve the loop"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "43. Detection"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Browser: PerformanceObserver on 'longtask' entries",
            "Node: monitorEventLoopDelay or an event-loop-lag metric",
            "Priority inversion: a timer stuck behind a flood of microtasks",
            "There the queue length, not the CPU, is the bottleneck"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
