          "type": "heading",
          "text": "46. Styles That Schedule"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Callbacks fire whenever the API decides, sometimes sync (Zalgo)",
            "Promises always defer to a microtask: ordering is deterministic",
            "async/await and .then chains schedule identically",
            "await reads better; .then wins for fan-out you must not serialize"
          ]
        }
